    {
      "id": "cave-bones",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 3400,
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        "A pack, propped upright against the cave wall as if set down for a moment.",
        "The bedroll is still rolled. Whoever owned it meant to come back for it."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Take what's useful",
        "Leave it as it stands"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Flint, a coil of good wire, and eleven coppers in a knotted cloth.",
        "You set it straighter against the wall and go on into the dark."
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "gold": 11,
          "artifacts": 1
        },
        {
          "mark": {
            "kindness": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cave-corran-mark",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 4750,
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        "Someone has cut a mark into the rock at head height — a crossed circle, the sign a debt is owed and remembered.",
        "Beneath it, scratched smaller: FOR THE ONE WHO STOPPED. And an arrow, pointing east.",
        "Wedged in the crack below is a stoppered flask, left for whoever came after."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Take it"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "It is good spirit, and it is still sealed. He came through here alive, then, and walking."
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "health": 25,
          "gold": 20,
          "mark": {
            "corran_sign": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "requiresAny": [
        "@corran=saved",
        "fst-wounded=0"
      ]
    }
  ],
